{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Vanessa Works the Evening Shift"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "On the Phone, Again!"}, {"type": "position", "content": 9}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 6}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.2"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": " Identify and describe events in the news in a range of social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn7le06ob09re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Phrasal Verbs  "}, {"type": "describer", "content": " There are various phrasal verbs that are used to talk about different things. Here is list of phrasal verbs for talking on the phone and one list for talking about health."}, {"type": "text", "content": "A phrasal verb is constructed with a:<br/>verb + particle/preposition<br/> ... to form a different meaning from the verb alone."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":11,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Phrasal Verb\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to get through\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"italic\\\">I've called several times, but I don't seem to be able to get through to the manager.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"to hang on/ to hold on\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Could you hold on while I look at my schedule?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to put through\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Could you put me through to customer service please?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to speak up\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Could you speak up? I can hardly hear you.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to cut off\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Hi, I'm calling again because we got cut off somehow.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to build up\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"italic\\\"> After being sick for a few days, I have to build up my strength again.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to put on (weight)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"italic\\\"> I have to be careful with sweets so that I don't put on weight.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to throw up\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"italic\\\"> I threw up twice last night. I might have the flu.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to catch up\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"italic\\\"> I usually catch up on my sleep on the weekend.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" to sleep in\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"italic\\\"> I'd better sleep in tomorrow to catch up on my rest.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "If you keep up the stressful work schedule, you burn out eventually."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I'm tired, but I'm hanging in there."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Zero Conditional  "}, {"type": "describer", "content": "  You use the zero conditional when the result of the condition is always true, like a scientific fact."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">The Zero Conditional</span><br/>Notice that you are thinking about a result that is always true for this condition. You are not thinking about the future or the past, or even the present.<br/><span class=\"italic\">Example: If you don't eat, you will get hungry.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use the Present Simple tense to write the zero conditional. The important thing about the zero conditional is that the condition always has the same result."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Condition\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Result\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> If I keep this phone call short,</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> you get back to your work more quickly.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> If you are stressed all the time,</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> you burn out eventually.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> When people get to sleep in,</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> they feel a lot better.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to thin out"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to gradually decrease in number"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It's late, so the dinner crowd is thinning out in the restaurant. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le06ob09aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use to talk about staying healthy."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to hang in there"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " to try hard to continue"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It's been a busy and stressful day, but I'm hanging in there."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le06ob09aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": 